            <div xml:id="d636">

                <pb facs="0776" n="768" sameAs="frus:frus1938v02/pg768"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.90G2/32: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Iraq</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Barbour</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-08-04T20:00:00-04:00">August 4, 1938—8 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>15. Your 18, July 28, noon. Alternative (2) acceptable. How soon can treaty be
                    prepared for signature? Department would like to <pb facs="0777" n="769"
                        xml:id="pg769"/> have it signed at earliest date practicable. Will Iraq
                    Government accept telegraphic full powers?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
